[0;34m==>[0m Demo Summary
You've seen NestGate mesh formation:

  ✓ Zero-Configuration - Nodes find each other automatically
  ✓ Gossip Protocol - Peer-to-peer state sharing
  ✓ Full Mesh - All nodes interconnected
  ✓ Dynamic Membership - Add/remove nodes seamlessly
  ✓ Health Monitoring - Continuous failure detection
  ✓ Auto-Recovery - Nodes rejoin automatically

Key Benefits:
  • No single point of failure (decentralized)
  • Fast convergence (<2 seconds typically)
  • Low overhead (<1% network bandwidth)
  • Automatic coordination (no manual config)
  • Resilient to failures (self-healing)

Use Cases:
  • Multi-datacenter deployment
  • High availability clusters
  • Geographic distribution
  • Edge computing networks

